### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Cadastro de usuário
POST http://localhost:3000/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste@email.com",
  "senha": "123456"
}

### Login
# Copiar o token da resposta e colar no Authorization das rotas de tarefas
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste@email.com",
  "senha": "123456"
}

### Listar usuários (sem senha)
GET http://localhost:3000/usuarios

### Atualizar usuário
PUT http://localhost:3000/usuarios/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "novo@email.com",
  "senha": "654321"
}

### Deletar usuário
DELETE http://localhost:3000/usuarios/1

### Listar tarefas do usuário logado
GET http://localhost:3000/tarefas
Authorization: Bearer cole_o_token_aqui

### Criar tarefa
POST http://localhost:3000/tarefas
Authorization: Bearer cole_o_token_aqui
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Estudar Node.js",
  "descricao": "Revisar Fastify, pg e JWT"
}

### Atualizar tarefa
PUT http://localhost:3000/tarefas/1
Authorization: Bearer cole_o_token_aqui
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Estudar Node.js (atualizado)",
  "descricao": "Testar as rotas no REST Client"
}

### Deletar tarefa
DELETE http://localhost:3000/tarefas/1
Authorization: Bearer cole_o_token_aqui
